## Summary

I recently had performance issues with a vision model so I created a somewhat small minimal repro setup. I benchmarked a small CNN training loop on Apple MPS using equivalent Burn and PyTorch repros. Even when both use the same backend family (burn-tch / libtorch vs PyTorch on MPS) and similar model, loss, optimizer, and tensor shapes, the Burn version is significantly slower.

